WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.120 --> 01:38.000
=Episode 27=

01:42.680 --> 01:43.799
Why are there sesame flatbreads here?

01:44.519 --> 01:46.040
Don't you know I can't tolerate spices?

01:46.359 --> 01:47.239
Young Madam,

01:47.319 --> 01:47.760
this...

01:47.760 --> 01:49.480
Concubine Wu made it herself.

01:49.480 --> 01:50.920
She said she specially learned

01:50.920 --> 01:52.079
how they make it in Ganlin.

01:54.519 --> 01:55.120
Enough.

01:56.319 --> 01:57.319
She meant well.

02:34.560 --> 02:38.960
(Graceful and Virtuous)

02:41.080 --> 02:41.800
Young Master.

02:44.000 --> 02:45.240
The tea is ready.

02:53.599 --> 02:54.560
Today,

02:54.879 --> 02:55.719
you went to see her?

02:58.120 --> 03:00.199
You gave me a home, Young Master.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.319
Now I no longer

03:03.000 --> 03:04.159
worry about my next meal.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.759
You and Madam Zhao

03:09.759 --> 03:11.120
are both my benefactors.

03:23.439 --> 03:24.479
What else did you talk about?

03:26.919 --> 03:28.400
I've never been to the northwest,

03:29.759 --> 03:31.199
so I chatted with her

03:32.039 --> 03:33.599
about the wind and sand in Ganlin,

03:34.400 --> 03:35.400
and...

03:40.039 --> 03:41.479
horses galloping
through the desert poplar forests.

03:52.240 --> 03:53.919
I went to see Miss Wu today.

03:54.560 --> 03:55.439
She told me

03:56.520 --> 03:57.439
Madam Yu

03:57.439 --> 03:59.280
meant to use
the Grand Empress Dowager's wish

03:59.479 --> 04:01.360
to be buried beside the founding emperor

04:01.520 --> 04:02.520
to set a trap for you.

04:03.800 --> 04:05.280
At the birthday banquet,

04:05.680 --> 04:07.000
the reminder not to honor only my father

04:07.120 --> 04:08.080
while neglecting my grandmother

04:08.599 --> 04:10.319
seemed to be meant for me,

04:10.759 --> 04:11.680
but in truth,

04:12.000 --> 04:13.439
it was meant for His Majesty.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.240
Others saw you at odds with
Grand Secretary Yu

04:17.480 --> 04:18.800
and didn't want to get involved,

04:19.000 --> 04:20.319
so no one warned you.

04:22.920 --> 04:24.480
No wonder His Majesty's
attitude changed so suddenly.

04:25.439 --> 04:26.720
Anyone in his position

04:27.399 --> 04:28.439
would have been angry.

04:30.319 --> 04:32.199
His Majesty personally raised me
through the ranks.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.959
Yet in this matter,

04:35.360 --> 04:36.800
I fell right into someone else's trap

04:37.000 --> 04:37.959
and put him in a difficult position.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.079
Then His Majesty must blame me
for two things.

04:44.040 --> 04:45.000
First,

04:45.319 --> 04:46.120
for being incompetent.

04:46.439 --> 04:47.439
Second, my lack of foresight.

04:50.319 --> 04:51.560
I'll go ask for His Majesty's
forgiveness tomorrow.

04:53.759 --> 04:54.399
Mr. Zhao,

04:56.560 --> 04:58.199
your loyalty may be sincere,

04:59.439 --> 05:00.959
but you still need to be careful.

05:02.040 --> 05:03.600
The man who sits on the throne today

05:04.439 --> 05:05.879
is no longer the Sixteenth Master

05:05.879 --> 05:07.040
we knew in Yongning.

05:13.399 --> 05:14.759
When a man

05:16.360 --> 05:18.040
gains absolute power,

05:22.199 --> 05:24.439
how much of his old innocence

05:26.279 --> 05:27.439
can really remain?

05:31.319 --> 05:33.120
The Emperor's favor is easy to lose
and hard to regain.

05:34.120 --> 05:35.399
We need to think this through carefully

05:36.759 --> 05:38.000
if we're going to turn this around.

05:43.319 --> 05:44.079
Back then,

05:47.279 --> 05:49.439
I urged you to accept Sixteenth Master's
letter of introduction,

05:51.439 --> 05:53.560
believing it was a rare opportunity.

06:20.079 --> 06:21.040
Take care, Young Master.

06:30.240 --> 06:30.920
My Lady,

06:31.439 --> 06:32.480
try this.

06:36.680 --> 06:37.879
After all these years,

06:38.399 --> 06:39.800
how could he possibly remember

06:40.920 --> 06:42.319
what Madam Zhao's sesame flatbreads

06:42.480 --> 06:44.360
tasted like back then?

06:45.040 --> 06:46.519
He's just found an excuse

06:47.079 --> 06:48.839
to indulge in his own sentimentality.

06:49.319 --> 06:51.399
The two people who truly love each other

06:51.839 --> 06:53.160
only ate that sesame flatbread

06:53.279 --> 06:54.959
to stave off hunger on the march.

06:57.519 --> 06:58.720
Look at them now.

06:59.199 --> 07:00.000
Do they still eat it?

07:01.000 --> 07:03.240
(Hold Fast to the Mean)
"I misunderstood Your Majesty."

07:04.920 --> 07:06.160
Then tell me.

07:06.519 --> 07:07.160
What

07:07.360 --> 07:08.680
exactly were my intentions?

07:09.360 --> 07:09.959
Your Majesty,

07:10.399 --> 07:11.319
I was foolish.

07:11.680 --> 07:13.720
All the people under heaven
are Your Majesty's subjects,

07:15.040 --> 07:16.439
yet I cared only for one corner
of the realm

07:16.439 --> 07:17.439
and failed to understand

07:17.720 --> 07:19.600
Your Majesty's concern
for all your people.

07:21.160 --> 07:22.160
I deserve punishment.

07:22.439 --> 07:24.439
I gave you the courtesy name Huchen

07:25.040 --> 07:25.920
so you could

07:25.920 --> 07:27.199
help shoulder my burdens,

07:27.439 --> 07:29.439
not create more problems for me.

07:36.439 --> 07:37.199
Rise.

07:46.720 --> 07:47.399
Your Majesty,

07:47.959 --> 07:48.680
I

07:49.079 --> 07:50.319
have thought about this day and night

07:50.680 --> 07:51.839
and am deeply ashamed.

07:53.040 --> 07:54.800
I beg Your Majesty to give me

07:56.759 --> 07:58.439
a chance to redeem myself
through service.

07:58.759 --> 07:59.600
Have you

08:00.120 --> 08:01.720
found some way to raise money?

08:04.439 --> 08:05.600
To meet the immediate need,

08:08.680 --> 08:09.759
we could reallocate some funds.

08:12.319 --> 08:13.519
The other day, I heard

08:14.000 --> 08:15.360
that Grand Secretary Yu mentioned

08:15.560 --> 08:17.480
that the Ministry of Works requested
one hundred thousand taels

08:18.800 --> 08:20.000
to renovate the imperial mausoleum.

08:20.839 --> 08:21.600
I believe

08:24.040 --> 08:25.519
that project could be postponed.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.440
Zhao Ling.

08:34.240 --> 08:35.519
Did you know

08:36.840 --> 08:37.759
that I

08:38.200 --> 08:39.759
grew up in the Cold Palace?

08:41.919 --> 08:42.799
I...

08:46.919 --> 08:47.919
have heard something of it.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.440
My father doted on the Noble Consort

08:51.480 --> 08:52.720
and neglected the other consorts.

08:52.960 --> 08:54.000
My birth mother

08:54.000 --> 08:55.200
was only a palace maid.

08:55.679 --> 08:57.399
Fearing the favored consort
would harm me,

08:57.399 --> 08:59.159
she hid me away in the Cold Palace.

08:59.799 --> 09:00.919
My father didn't even know

09:01.159 --> 09:03.200
he had a son until I was six.

09:04.200 --> 09:04.879
Later,

09:05.000 --> 09:07.039
my grandmother took me out
of the Cold Palace

09:07.039 --> 09:08.200
and raised me with great care.

09:08.720 --> 09:09.960
Everything I have today

09:10.279 --> 09:11.240
is entirely

09:11.440 --> 09:12.879
thanks to her.

09:13.559 --> 09:15.080
The Grand Empress Dowager's kindness

09:16.360 --> 09:17.200
is clear

09:17.399 --> 09:18.440
to all ministers.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.000
Filial devotion is the foremost virtue.

09:20.440 --> 09:21.799
In my heart,

09:21.799 --> 09:24.159
I want to grant her every wish.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.120
But I am the Emperor.

09:26.519 --> 09:27.759
If I am to rule through filial virtue,

09:27.759 --> 09:29.159
I cannot honor only my grandmother

09:29.279 --> 09:30.240
while dishonoring my late father.

09:31.360 --> 09:33.039
My father refused her wish

09:33.399 --> 09:35.039
for the same reason.

09:39.159 --> 09:40.120
Thank you, Your Majesty,

09:40.960 --> 09:42.240
for telling me the truth.

09:43.399 --> 09:44.519
The imperial mausoleum

09:44.840 --> 09:46.440
must be renovated

09:46.440 --> 09:48.320
to fulfill my grandmother's wish

09:48.600 --> 09:49.919
to be buried beside my grandfather.

09:50.519 --> 09:51.759
And the cost

09:51.840 --> 09:53.039
will be far more than one hundred
thousand taels.

09:55.159 --> 09:56.840
It truly puts me
in a difficult position.

10:05.159 --> 10:05.879
Commander Zhao,

10:06.559 --> 10:07.919
what His Majesty just said

10:09.240 --> 10:10.799
came from the heart.

10:11.919 --> 10:13.519
But when it comes
to the imperial family,

10:14.919 --> 10:16.519
you must read between the lines.

10:18.399 --> 10:20.360
This business of renovating
the imperial mausoleum

10:24.600 --> 10:26.399
is a poisoned chalice.

10:27.520 --> 10:28.960
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

10:28.960 --> 10:30.120
What I'm afraid of

10:31.000 --> 10:33.000
is that His Majesty never wanted
the mausoleum renovated at all,

10:33.440 --> 10:34.559
much less grant

10:34.559 --> 10:35.799
Her Majesty's wish
to rest with the late emperor.

10:36.879 --> 10:37.600
Yes.

10:38.759 --> 10:40.039
But given who he is,

10:41.879 --> 10:43.279
he's the one person
who can't say it outright.

10:49.159 --> 10:51.120
I've crossed swords with Madam Yu
several times.

10:52.200 --> 10:53.159
This time

10:54.559 --> 10:56.320
was the hardest trap to escape.

10:58.240 --> 11:00.000
(Hall of Supreme Harmony)

11:00.039 --> 11:01.120
As for the drought,

11:01.360 --> 11:02.720
open the granaries
and release grain first

11:03.039 --> 11:04.480
to meet the immediate need.

11:05.080 --> 11:06.240
Then proceed with the salt reform

11:06.240 --> 11:07.440
to replenish the treasury

11:07.679 --> 11:08.759
for future needs.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.960
As Your Majesty commands.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.480
My ministers,

11:12.720 --> 11:13.919
is there anything else to report?

11:15.759 --> 11:16.759
Your Majesty,

11:17.039 --> 11:18.399
the Grand Empress Dowager has ordered

11:18.399 --> 11:19.679
the imperial mausoleum to be expanded.

11:19.919 --> 11:20.960
The budget of one hundred thousand taels

11:21.039 --> 11:22.399
is nowhere near enough.

11:22.519 --> 11:24.519
We've spent days trying every way
to raise more funds,

11:24.759 --> 11:26.279
but with so little silver available,

11:26.279 --> 11:27.720
no one dares take on the task.

11:27.879 --> 11:28.519
Your Majesty,

11:28.799 --> 11:30.519
we truly don't know what to do.

11:41.240 --> 11:41.840
Your Majesty,

11:42.279 --> 11:42.960
I am

11:45.399 --> 11:46.720
willing to assist the Ministry of Works

11:48.039 --> 11:49.080
with the project.

11:50.039 --> 11:50.759
Good.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.440
You've always been resourceful.

11:53.159 --> 11:54.440
If you handle this well,

11:54.679 --> 11:55.759
you will be richly rewarded.

12:08.960 --> 12:09.519
Grand Secretary,

12:09.600 --> 12:12.080
Zhao Ling really doesn't know
what he's getting himself into.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.240
He actually dared to take this on.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.720
Sooner or later,

12:14.720 --> 12:16.039
he'll either anger His Majesty

12:16.039 --> 12:16.840
or offend

12:16.840 --> 12:17.720
the Grand Empress Dowager.

12:18.120 --> 12:18.879
Either way,

12:18.879 --> 12:20.399
he's doomed.

12:21.320 --> 12:22.080
Lord Liu,

12:23.360 --> 12:24.559
whether he wanted the job or not,

12:24.559 --> 12:26.039
was never really up to him.

12:26.559 --> 12:27.519
After all,

12:27.519 --> 12:29.120
he's desperate to turn things around.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.879
Do you think he can?

12:31.159 --> 12:31.879
We

12:31.879 --> 12:33.519
can just wait for the good news.

13:07.480 --> 13:09.360
Word just came from court.

13:09.360 --> 13:10.080
They say

13:10.080 --> 13:12.120
Commander Zhao has taken
on the imperial mausoleum project.

13:13.000 --> 13:14.480
Did I hear that correctly?

13:15.600 --> 13:16.600
Zhao Ling

13:17.039 --> 13:19.120
has taken on the imperial mausoleum
project?

13:23.120 --> 13:25.679
I've raised this every year,
and every year it was put off.

13:26.720 --> 13:28.200
Why did he

13:28.440 --> 13:30.320
suddenly approve it this year?

13:34.519 --> 13:36.679
They say grandchildren are closest
to their grandparents.

13:37.720 --> 13:40.519
My grandson does care for me after all.

13:40.840 --> 13:41.559
Indeed.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.759
I remember

13:44.679 --> 13:46.039
Madam Zhao

13:46.879 --> 13:48.120
was quite clever.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.879
Have her come to the palace

13:54.080 --> 13:55.759
and keep me company for a while.

14:07.960 --> 14:10.200
Greetings, Grand Empress Dowager.

14:10.440 --> 14:12.440
I wish Your Majesty good health.

14:12.919 --> 14:13.879
Rise.

14:14.159 --> 14:15.679
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:17.879 --> 14:19.279
I hear

14:19.440 --> 14:21.039
Commander Zhao

14:21.200 --> 14:23.000
has taken on the imperial mausoleum
project.

14:24.480 --> 14:25.039
I...

14:28.240 --> 14:29.200
I

14:29.200 --> 14:30.679
hadn't heard about that yet.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.919
So this is news to you?

14:36.360 --> 14:37.320
I suppose

14:37.519 --> 14:39.200
it was decided rather suddenly.

14:39.679 --> 14:41.039
But do you think

14:41.440 --> 14:43.360
one hundred thousand taels

14:43.440 --> 14:44.399
will be enough?

14:46.080 --> 14:47.480
What could Commander Zhao possibly do

14:47.759 --> 14:49.399
to somehow

14:49.399 --> 14:51.039
come up with more money?

14:52.559 --> 14:53.679
I'm afraid I'm not wise enough to say.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.519
Matters of state like these

14:56.440 --> 14:57.960
are not for me to speculate on.

15:03.519 --> 15:04.519
Your Majesty,

15:04.720 --> 15:06.399
the renshen tonic from the Imperial
Pharmacy is ready.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.159
This was

15:16.360 --> 15:18.279
a tribute from a foreign kingdom.

15:18.279 --> 15:19.840
There's only enough for one person.

15:20.600 --> 15:21.679
The imperial physician says

15:21.799 --> 15:23.200
it can relieve headaches.

15:23.799 --> 15:25.120
As it happens,

15:25.440 --> 15:27.000
the Emperor takes after me in this.

15:27.360 --> 15:29.080
We both suffer from headaches.

15:29.480 --> 15:31.039
Yet he has them prepare

15:31.240 --> 15:32.919
a bowl for me every day

15:32.919 --> 15:34.360
and send it here.

15:36.320 --> 15:37.519
The tonic is precious.

15:37.840 --> 15:38.879
Your Majesty,

15:38.879 --> 15:39.799
please drink it while it's hot.

15:42.480 --> 15:44.039
There's only one bowl each day,

15:44.159 --> 15:45.759
enough for just one person.

15:45.759 --> 15:47.440
How could I bear to drink it myself?

15:49.120 --> 15:50.240
I save it

15:50.720 --> 15:53.000
until he comes to pay his respects
each day,

15:53.279 --> 15:55.360
then mix it into another tonic

15:55.440 --> 15:57.000
and give it to him instead.

15:59.559 --> 16:00.679
The Emperor

16:00.679 --> 16:03.600
has often praised Commander Zhao
for his cleverness and ability.

16:04.080 --> 16:05.799
As for the imperial mausoleum,

16:06.120 --> 16:07.879
I'm counting on Commander Zhao.

16:10.039 --> 16:10.919
I

16:10.919 --> 16:11.960
will be sure to tell him.

16:15.760 --> 16:18.160
(List of Disbursements)

16:36.279 --> 16:38.279
Still worried about the mausoleum
project?

16:40.440 --> 16:42.080
The money isn't really the problem.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.879
The real problem

16:53.519 --> 16:54.480
is His Majesty

16:56.399 --> 16:58.440
doesn't want the mausoleum
renovated at all.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.679
The Grand Empress Dowager

17:01.960 --> 17:03.279
has high hopes for you.

17:03.360 --> 17:04.839
But if I follow His Majesty's wishes,

17:07.480 --> 17:08.960
I'll inevitably offend her.

17:13.440 --> 17:14.759
I have an idea.

17:27.599 --> 17:28.599
Your Majesty,

17:28.960 --> 17:30.400
the relief funds have been distributed
to the prefectures.

17:30.799 --> 17:31.359
However,

17:31.440 --> 17:32.759
the disaster is widespread,

17:32.759 --> 17:33.880
and the funds are far from enough.

17:34.039 --> 17:34.920
We still need

17:34.920 --> 17:36.160
more money and grain

17:36.160 --> 17:37.119
to relieve

17:37.119 --> 17:39.039
the people's desperate suffering.

17:41.839 --> 17:42.440
Your Majesty,

17:42.839 --> 17:43.559
the disaster victims

17:43.559 --> 17:45.079
have begun storming the state granaries.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.400
If we don't act quickly,

17:46.400 --> 17:47.839
there may be widespread unrest.

17:48.799 --> 17:49.759
My ministers,

17:49.960 --> 17:51.799
does anyone have another solution?

17:56.119 --> 17:57.119
Your Majesty,

17:57.799 --> 17:58.519
the drought

17:59.039 --> 18:00.079
is a calamity of nature.

18:00.440 --> 18:02.200
We should seek our ancestors'
protection.

18:02.839 --> 18:03.880
I propose that we discuss

18:05.599 --> 18:07.319
the renovation of the imperial
mausoleum.

18:09.079 --> 18:10.920
It should be carried out
to the highest standard,

18:11.160 --> 18:12.319
with a golden coffin
and jade outer casket,

18:12.559 --> 18:13.839
all in accordance with imperial rites.

18:22.599 --> 18:24.599
With the drought crisis upon us,

18:25.559 --> 18:27.400
disaster relief should come first.

18:28.160 --> 18:29.440
Huchen,

18:30.240 --> 18:32.119
that's rather unexpected.

18:34.200 --> 18:35.279
Your Majesty,

18:35.480 --> 18:36.240
filial devotion

18:36.440 --> 18:37.519
is a foundation of the state.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.279
As for disaster relief,

18:39.680 --> 18:41.440
I will do everything I can
to raise the necessary funds.

18:42.079 --> 18:43.559
But the imperial mausoleum

18:43.799 --> 18:44.839
concerns the dignity of the state

18:44.839 --> 18:45.720
and cannot be taken lightly.

18:45.799 --> 18:46.440
Otherwise,

18:47.559 --> 18:49.559
it may tarnish Your Majesty's reputation
for filial devotion.

18:53.240 --> 18:55.160
You certainly remember

18:55.680 --> 18:57.319
every word I've said.

18:59.559 --> 19:00.279
I...

19:04.079 --> 19:05.240
I would never dare forget

19:05.720 --> 19:06.440
a single word you said.

19:08.839 --> 19:09.599
So you

19:10.440 --> 19:12.200
truly remember them all?

19:16.480 --> 19:17.039
Fine.

19:17.680 --> 19:19.599
Since you proposed renovating
the imperial mausoleum,

19:19.599 --> 19:21.079
I'll leave the project to you.

19:21.319 --> 19:22.519
If anything goes wrong,

19:22.519 --> 19:22.960
I

19:22.960 --> 19:24.039
will hold you personally responsible.

19:24.039 --> 19:24.480
Yes,

19:25.119 --> 19:26.000
Your Majesty.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.160
The court is dismissed.

19:27.359 --> 19:29.240
The court is dismissed!

19:29.440 --> 19:31.440
We respectfully
bid Your Majesty farewell.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.200
Grand Empress Dowager,

19:36.720 --> 19:38.559
I've already spoken with my husband.

19:39.319 --> 19:40.680
Renovating the imperial mausoleum

19:40.680 --> 19:41.960
is a matter of lasting importance.

19:42.440 --> 19:43.880
In our humble opinion,

19:44.119 --> 19:45.000
it should be

19:45.200 --> 19:45.880
done on a grand scale.

19:50.440 --> 19:51.759
The guardian beasts for the tomb

19:51.839 --> 19:52.720
should be carved

19:52.720 --> 19:53.839
from Hanbai white marble

19:53.920 --> 19:55.079
to properly display imperial grandeur.

19:55.799 --> 19:57.319
The ceiling of the underground palace

19:57.880 --> 19:59.079
could be set

19:59.319 --> 20:00.759
with luminous pearls from the South Sea,

20:01.200 --> 20:03.400
with a coffin and outer casket
of golden-thread nanmu wood.

20:03.599 --> 20:04.599
Only then would it reflect

20:04.599 --> 20:05.599
the grandeur of the imperial house.

20:05.599 --> 20:06.039
This...

20:06.400 --> 20:06.839
This is

20:06.839 --> 20:08.799
far too extravagant.

20:09.279 --> 20:10.960
Isn't the budget only one hundred
thousand taels?

20:12.759 --> 20:13.799
These are

20:14.599 --> 20:16.839
honors Your Majesty rightly deserves.

20:19.839 --> 20:20.920
Forgive me. I spoke out of turn.

20:28.799 --> 20:29.880
Tell the Emperor

20:30.720 --> 20:32.240
I want a pair

20:32.240 --> 20:34.119
of three-chi-tall Hanbai white marble
tomb guardians,

20:34.519 --> 20:37.119
twelve luminous pearls the size
of pigeon's eggs,

20:37.720 --> 20:39.200
and golden-thread nanmu wood.

20:40.599 --> 20:42.359
Write all of that down for now.

20:42.359 --> 20:43.000
Yes.

20:46.880 --> 20:47.559
Mr. Zhao.

20:49.319 --> 20:50.079
You wanted to see me?

20:51.440 --> 20:53.680
The court has put me in charge
of renovating the imperial mausoleum.

20:55.799 --> 20:56.880
Have you heard of that?

20:58.319 --> 20:59.799
So the job fell to you?

21:01.440 --> 21:02.759
That's a lucrative assignment.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.599
I proposed to the Ministry of Works

21:05.480 --> 21:07.519
that we bring in private merchants
and craftsmen

21:08.119 --> 21:09.920
and pool everyone's resources
to get it done.

21:10.839 --> 21:11.799
The court has no money.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.720
It approved only one hundred
thousand taels.

21:14.519 --> 21:15.759
But I want to make it look

21:15.759 --> 21:17.039
like a million-tael project.

21:17.839 --> 21:19.319
Would you be willing

21:21.079 --> 21:22.440
to help me work with the merchants?

21:23.519 --> 21:24.440
One hundred thousand...

21:42.079 --> 21:43.559
No need

21:44.039 --> 21:44.960
to trouble yourself over this.

21:46.279 --> 21:47.839
I'll put the word out first

21:47.960 --> 21:49.359
that this mausoleum project

21:49.359 --> 21:51.119
will be built to a million-tael
standard.

21:52.359 --> 21:54.440
Merchants eager to curry favor
with the authorities

21:54.559 --> 21:55.440
will naturally offer discounts.

21:55.440 --> 21:55.920
Mr. Jin,

21:56.039 --> 21:57.319
we'll cut the price by 30%.

21:57.319 --> 21:58.519
As for the actual cost,

21:58.519 --> 21:59.359
don't worry.

21:59.680 --> 22:01.440
I guarantee we'll keep it
under one hundred thousand taels.

22:01.440 --> 22:02.119
And the materials

22:02.119 --> 22:03.000
won't be inferior either.

22:03.359 --> 22:04.759
Top-grade golden-thread nanmu wood

22:04.759 --> 22:06.240
will be supplied at cost.

22:06.839 --> 22:09.279
These merchants may make
less profit now,

22:09.960 --> 22:12.559
but afterward they'll have the prestige
of being imperial suppliers.

22:13.559 --> 22:15.160
Once we can call ourselves suppliers
to the imperial household,

22:15.160 --> 22:16.960
our descendants will benefit from it
for generations.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.599
Exactly.

22:19.480 --> 22:21.039
They're thinking long term.

22:21.160 --> 22:21.839
We

22:22.279 --> 22:23.160
just need what we can get now.

22:25.400 --> 22:27.160
To gain the Emperor's favor,

22:27.799 --> 22:30.319
Zhao Ling dared to take on
the imperial mausoleum project.

22:30.839 --> 22:32.279
At court today,

22:32.960 --> 22:35.079
he openly called for lavish construction

22:35.279 --> 22:36.079
and is even

22:36.079 --> 22:37.000
among merchants

22:37.000 --> 22:39.160
and in the streets, making a great show
of it.

22:39.519 --> 22:40.599
As expected of someone

22:40.759 --> 22:42.839
born into the lowly merchant class.

22:43.519 --> 22:45.440
He has no grasp of the imperial family's
true intentions.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.839
His Majesty's move

22:47.240 --> 22:49.880
was meant to ensure the project
could never succeed.

22:50.759 --> 22:53.440
Since he insists
on jumping into the flames,

22:53.559 --> 22:55.160
we might as well

22:55.599 --> 22:58.279
add fuel to the fire.

22:58.599 --> 22:59.799
Ladies and gentlemen,

23:00.160 --> 23:02.559
just think what a million taels
of silver

23:02.920 --> 23:04.839
could do if it were used
for disaster relief.

23:05.240 --> 23:07.000
How many lives could it save?

23:07.000 --> 23:08.359
Exactly!

23:08.359 --> 23:09.559
But now,

23:09.559 --> 23:10.720
it's all going

23:10.799 --> 23:12.960
straight into the ground!

23:12.960 --> 23:13.720
Absurd!

23:14.119 --> 23:15.119
People are starving to death

23:15.200 --> 23:16.440
in droves outside the city,

23:16.599 --> 23:17.720
and yet the court

23:17.720 --> 23:18.759
wants to spend

23:18.759 --> 23:19.920
millions of taels of silver

23:19.920 --> 23:21.160
on some grand tomb for the dead!

23:21.240 --> 23:22.519
Tell me, isn't that outrageous?

23:22.559 --> 23:23.400
Exactly!

23:23.759 --> 23:24.319
Outrageous!

23:24.319 --> 23:24.960
Your Majesty,

23:25.119 --> 23:26.559
people are starving and dying
along the roads,

23:26.559 --> 23:27.519
and the people can barely survive,

23:27.680 --> 23:29.960
yet a million taels are to be spent
on the imperial mausoleum.

23:31.200 --> 23:31.680
I

23:31.680 --> 23:32.680
dare ask,

23:32.960 --> 23:33.880
does Your Majesty

23:34.079 --> 23:35.599
still care for the people of this realm?

23:38.359 --> 23:39.000
Absurd!

23:39.400 --> 23:41.000
When did I ever say a million taels?

23:41.119 --> 23:42.400
Wasn't the budget only one hundred
thousand?

23:56.319 --> 23:57.000
Zhao Ling.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.759
What I agreed with you on

23:58.759 --> 23:59.960
was a budget of one hundred
thousand taels.

24:00.200 --> 24:01.519
Where did the million taels

24:01.519 --> 24:02.519
come from?

24:02.960 --> 24:03.559
Your Majesty,

24:04.079 --> 24:04.759
I

24:04.880 --> 24:06.000
deserve death for my crime.

24:06.279 --> 24:07.519
What good would your death do?

24:07.519 --> 24:09.079
Would it silence the people's anger?

24:09.079 --> 24:10.440
Do you know how many people

24:10.440 --> 24:12.440
inside and outside the capital
are condemning me beyond these walls?

24:12.440 --> 24:13.759
Even if you were cut to pieces

24:13.759 --> 24:14.440
and died countless deaths,

24:14.440 --> 24:15.599
you still couldn't answer for this.

24:16.039 --> 24:18.160
Please calm yourself, Your Majesty.

24:19.799 --> 24:20.400
I

24:20.519 --> 24:21.440
must have been

24:23.839 --> 24:25.200
utterly blind and foolish

24:25.519 --> 24:26.839
to entrust affairs of state

24:26.839 --> 24:28.440
to a wretch like you.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.519
Effective immediately,

24:29.599 --> 24:31.119
Zhao Ling is stripped
of all official posts

24:31.119 --> 24:32.000
and reduced to a commoner.

24:33.440 --> 24:34.759
Thank you, Your Majesty.

24:56.839 --> 24:57.440
The court is dismissed.

24:58.240 --> 24:59.960
The court is dismissed!

25:00.240 --> 25:02.319
We respectfully
bid Your Majesty farewell.

25:05.920 --> 25:08.240
After all this careful planning,

25:09.160 --> 25:10.359
Zhao Ling

25:11.559 --> 25:14.079
is finally stripped of office
and out of the game.

25:14.480 --> 25:15.240
Here.

25:15.599 --> 25:16.720
Let's use tea in place of wine

25:17.400 --> 25:18.519
and celebrate together.

25:19.880 --> 25:20.440
My dear,

25:20.920 --> 25:22.359
you've worked hard as well.

25:29.079 --> 25:30.599
With that nuisance out of the way,

25:31.039 --> 25:32.440
the salt reform...

25:32.440 --> 25:34.039
No more obstacles.

25:34.839 --> 25:36.400
His Majesty has no objections either?

25:36.480 --> 25:39.119
What His Majesty thinks
no longer matters.

25:40.319 --> 25:42.119
Once I set the Anzhou and Yan merchants

25:42.119 --> 25:43.839
against one another and threw everything
into chaos,

25:43.839 --> 25:45.319
many things

25:45.480 --> 25:47.519
could no longer be stopped

25:47.680 --> 25:49.160
or delayed at will.

25:51.279 --> 25:52.559
That is power.

25:53.400 --> 25:54.720
It can make anyone

25:55.160 --> 25:56.799
do what they don't want to do,

25:57.480 --> 25:58.960
even the Emperor.

26:02.759 --> 26:03.519
Father,

26:04.759 --> 26:06.359
do you think Zhao Ling

26:06.359 --> 26:07.519
can still make a comeback?

26:08.920 --> 26:10.559
The closer we get to the end,

26:10.880 --> 26:12.440
the more carefully we must proceed.

26:14.160 --> 26:15.440
That's the advantage

26:15.440 --> 26:17.039
of never choosing a side.

26:18.680 --> 26:20.599
What happens to everyone else

26:20.759 --> 26:22.759
has nothing to do with us.

26:24.079 --> 26:25.400
So you're saying

26:26.359 --> 26:27.559
he might survive?

26:27.960 --> 26:29.519
I never said that.

26:30.839 --> 26:33.039
I've simply lived long enough to know

26:33.039 --> 26:34.200
that when a man

26:34.880 --> 26:36.480
hits rock bottom,

26:36.880 --> 26:38.119
it is often

26:38.200 --> 26:40.319
the beginning of his climb back up.

26:41.359 --> 26:43.319
Here in the capital,

26:43.480 --> 26:44.519
the man

26:44.519 --> 26:45.880
down on his luck today

26:45.880 --> 26:46.799
may well become

26:47.000 --> 26:49.759
tomorrow's rising star at court.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.319
Mr. Zhao,

27:00.799 --> 27:01.559
I heard

27:01.880 --> 27:02.799
you've been dismissed.

27:03.039 --> 27:04.680
So what happens to our mausoleum deal?

27:05.079 --> 27:06.000
We already

27:07.359 --> 27:08.799
made such a big show of it.

27:09.240 --> 27:10.279
What I mean is,

27:10.960 --> 27:12.599
we can't let all that go to waste.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.440
The mausoleum

27:19.880 --> 27:21.160
will indeed no longer be renovated.

27:23.839 --> 27:24.720
But Mr. Jin,

27:25.440 --> 27:26.440
you're a capable businessman

27:27.119 --> 27:28.720
and have built up considerable capital
over the years.

27:29.720 --> 27:31.160
Even if I can no longer

27:31.160 --> 27:32.039
help you in the future,

27:34.400 --> 27:35.960
I'm sure your business will continue
to prosper.

27:39.599 --> 27:40.359
Mr. Zhao...

27:42.079 --> 27:43.119
Look at me, getting worked up.

27:44.519 --> 27:45.559
As for the salt business,

27:45.960 --> 27:47.079
we settled everything

27:47.079 --> 27:48.000
back in Yongning Prefecture.

27:48.480 --> 27:49.839
As long as you know your business,

27:52.160 --> 27:53.960
losing my support shouldn't hurt you.

27:56.200 --> 27:56.799
Mr. Zhao,

27:57.440 --> 27:57.880
I...

27:57.880 --> 27:59.000
Yuanbao, don't worry.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.319
Mr. Zhao

28:01.440 --> 28:02.960
got approval from the Ministry of Works

28:03.079 --> 28:04.200
for you.

28:04.920 --> 28:06.839
The mausoleum deal
may have fallen through,

28:07.000 --> 28:09.200
(Ministry of Works Permit)
but from now on, you may bid

28:09.279 --> 28:11.000
for government construction projects
in the capital.

28:45.839 --> 28:47.119
I'm afraid our friendship

28:48.480 --> 28:50.240
may come to an end someday.

28:54.839 --> 28:56.680
This moment is simply the hardest part.

28:59.559 --> 29:01.799
You've put your entire future
on the line.

29:02.440 --> 29:04.200
It's only natural that few people
would understand.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.839
He's suddenly lost the person
he relied on,

29:07.680 --> 29:08.680
so it's understandable

29:10.240 --> 29:11.079
that he's panicking now.

29:12.039 --> 29:13.200
If I lose this gamble,

29:14.200 --> 29:15.519
we'll go our separate ways,

29:16.039 --> 29:16.839
and he won't be implicated.

29:19.880 --> 29:21.480
But if I win...

29:29.319 --> 29:30.279
he can come back then.

29:39.000 --> 29:40.880
Right now, this is the only way out.

29:44.559 --> 29:45.599
Perhaps you're the only one

29:46.799 --> 29:47.880
who, win or lose,

29:49.799 --> 29:50.880
will still be by my side.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.440
A husband and wife move forward
together.

30:01.279 --> 30:02.440
That's what it means
to walk side by side.

30:03.759 --> 30:04.759
Get some rest.

30:05.680 --> 30:06.680
From here on,

30:07.960 --> 30:09.200
it's my turn to step in.

30:16.440 --> 30:18.200
How did things come to this?

30:18.480 --> 30:20.039
The drought is ravaging the land,

30:20.200 --> 30:21.480
and people are starving
to death everywhere.

30:21.599 --> 30:23.279
If the Emperor launches
a lavish construction project,

30:23.440 --> 30:24.599
what will the people think of him?

30:25.160 --> 30:26.519
What will the censors say?

30:26.519 --> 30:27.440
And how

30:27.680 --> 30:29.240
will history record him?

30:29.400 --> 30:29.880
Go.

30:30.680 --> 30:32.160
Summon Madam Zhao, nee Fu, to see me.

30:32.640 --> 30:35.440
(Boundless Longevity)

30:35.440 --> 30:36.799
I trusted that you and your husband

30:37.119 --> 30:38.559
were loyal,

30:38.559 --> 30:40.079
and that you understood filial duty.

30:40.319 --> 30:41.960
That is why I granted your request.

30:42.519 --> 30:43.359
Who would have thought

30:43.680 --> 30:45.559
it would lead to such disaster?

30:46.599 --> 30:47.440
Now

30:47.680 --> 30:49.039
the entire court is in an uproar,

30:49.359 --> 30:51.119
and the people are seething
with resentment.

30:52.119 --> 30:53.079
Fu,

30:54.119 --> 30:55.279
do you acknowledge your crimes?

30:56.400 --> 30:57.240
I

30:57.359 --> 30:58.319
deserve death for my crime.

30:58.920 --> 31:00.759
I ask to be punished by kneeling
outside Renshou Palace

31:01.200 --> 31:02.359
and reflecting on my wrongdoing,

31:02.480 --> 31:03.680
as a warning to others.

31:03.799 --> 31:05.839
I beg Your Majesty to grant my request.

31:05.839 --> 31:06.359
You...

31:09.240 --> 31:12.760
(Renshou Palace)

31:12.799 --> 31:13.720
I heard

31:13.720 --> 31:15.319
she was the one who talked
the Grand Empress Dowager

31:15.319 --> 31:16.119
into renovating the mausoleum

31:16.119 --> 31:17.119
despite the people's suffering.

31:17.680 --> 31:18.359
Serves her right.

31:18.759 --> 31:19.559
Exactly.

31:34.240 --> 31:36.200
Why not have her kneel by the wall

31:36.400 --> 31:37.599
so she doesn't block the nobles' way?

32:24.400 --> 32:26.560
(Six hours later)

32:55.280 --> 32:59.040
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

33:03.200 --> 33:07.080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

33:09.280 --> 33:13.720
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

33:14.280 --> 33:16.640
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

33:18.080 --> 33:22.560
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

33:27.039 --> 33:28.119
You've been kneeling for so long.

33:29.680 --> 33:30.920
Are you badly hurt?

33:33.799 --> 33:35.839
It's only some physical pain.

33:36.720 --> 33:37.759
It's nothing serious.

33:38.799 --> 33:40.440
As long as everything works out,

33:40.960 --> 33:41.920
all this suffering

33:42.400 --> 33:43.279
will have been worth it.

33:45.280 --> 33:49.080
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

33:49.319 --> 33:50.119
Let's go home first.

33:50.120 --> 33:55.000
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

34:02.519 --> 34:04.079
I heard Madam Zhao

34:04.079 --> 34:05.599
knelt outside Renshou Palace

34:05.599 --> 34:06.799
for an entire day.

34:06.799 --> 34:08.199
It's all because her husband

34:08.440 --> 34:10.440
insisted on taking on the mausoleum
project.

34:10.719 --> 34:11.599
And now,

34:11.599 --> 34:12.840
he's pleased with neither side

34:13.000 --> 34:14.199
and lost his position too.

34:14.400 --> 34:15.719
The way I see it,

34:16.039 --> 34:17.280
some people

34:17.280 --> 34:19.280
have sky-high ambitions,

34:19.360 --> 34:20.760
yet are born with little fortune.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.960
What nonsense are you talking?

34:25.360 --> 34:26.519
People from the northwest

34:26.519 --> 34:27.519
really are uncouth.

34:27.760 --> 34:28.519
Exactly.

34:28.519 --> 34:29.000
Yes.

34:29.719 --> 34:31.079
I'm from the northwest.

34:31.079 --> 34:32.239
Our soldiers in the northwest

34:32.239 --> 34:33.920
shed their blood on the frontier

34:33.920 --> 34:35.039
to defend this land.

34:35.719 --> 34:37.760
And all so you family memebers
of civil officials

34:37.760 --> 34:39.039
can sit around in the capital

34:39.039 --> 34:40.079
gossiping about others?

34:40.079 --> 34:40.519
You...

34:40.519 --> 34:41.199
What?

34:41.840 --> 34:43.199
Ladies, please calm down.

34:43.559 --> 34:44.679
Our husbands are all colleagues,

34:44.840 --> 34:45.880
and besides,

34:45.880 --> 34:47.800
today's banquet is hosted
by the Grand Empress Dowager herself.

34:48.280 --> 34:50.480
The Grand Empress Dowager has arrived!

34:53.280 --> 34:55.480
Greetings, Grand Empress Dowager!

34:55.800 --> 34:56.800
No need for formalities.

34:57.079 --> 34:59.199
Thank you, Grand Empress Dowager!

35:00.320 --> 35:01.400
Today,

35:01.400 --> 35:03.480
I summoned you all here

35:03.480 --> 35:05.199
to announce something.

35:06.159 --> 35:07.480
The Emperor, out of filial devotion,

35:08.079 --> 35:10.679
wished to renovate my mausoleum for me.

35:11.440 --> 35:14.039
But disaster now ravages the land,

35:14.239 --> 35:15.840
and the people are suffering.

35:16.119 --> 35:18.760
How could I let my own
burial arrangements

35:18.840 --> 35:21.199
bring suffering upon the people?

35:22.199 --> 35:23.559
By my decree,

35:24.440 --> 35:25.599
effective immediately,

35:26.920 --> 35:28.519
work on the imperial mausoleum
is suspended.

35:45.280 --> 35:45.880
Grandmother.

35:52.360 --> 35:53.480
This year,

35:53.599 --> 35:55.079
the drought is severe.

35:55.559 --> 35:57.199
The mausoleum

35:58.519 --> 35:59.840
can wait.

36:00.840 --> 36:02.480
Take the one hundred thousand taels

36:02.920 --> 36:04.360
and use it all for disaster relief.

36:05.000 --> 36:06.960
Hanbai white marble carvings,

36:07.159 --> 36:08.960
luminous pearls from the South Sea,

36:09.119 --> 36:10.519
golden-thread nanmu wood...

36:11.119 --> 36:13.880
none of them matters more
than the living.

36:16.519 --> 36:17.320
Grandmother,

36:18.039 --> 36:19.239
to me,

36:19.239 --> 36:20.320
you matter most of all.

36:21.159 --> 36:22.440
What I owe you

36:22.880 --> 36:24.039
is greater than what I owe my father,

36:24.360 --> 36:25.559
greater than what I owe my grandfather,

36:25.840 --> 36:27.519
greater than what I owe anyone
in this world.

36:28.239 --> 36:29.519
If you hadn't

36:29.519 --> 36:31.079
insisted on taking me out
of the Cold Palace,

36:31.280 --> 36:33.400
I might have died there as a child.

36:33.800 --> 36:35.400
I would never be where I am today.

36:36.800 --> 36:38.960
But you are the Emperor.

36:40.960 --> 36:42.199
Now get up.

36:48.159 --> 36:49.960
But now, what binds my hands

36:50.440 --> 36:52.519
is this very throne.

36:53.320 --> 36:55.480
It forces me to stand by and watch

36:56.079 --> 36:57.440
your lifelong wish go unfulfilled.

37:01.880 --> 37:03.719
Through your forbearance this time,

37:04.119 --> 37:06.119
you've saved me once again.

37:06.440 --> 37:07.280
You are giving up

37:07.679 --> 37:09.840
your longing to be reunited
with Grandfather

37:10.880 --> 37:12.719
and a wish you've held for decades.

37:17.320 --> 37:18.400
That's enough.

37:19.000 --> 37:21.199
You emperors

37:22.039 --> 37:23.519
are always so good with your words.

37:23.800 --> 37:25.000
Your grandfather,

37:25.400 --> 37:26.599
your father,

37:26.719 --> 37:27.840
and now you.

37:30.760 --> 37:32.840
But you're the smoothest talker
of them all,

37:34.199 --> 37:35.239
and somehow,

37:35.719 --> 37:37.679
I always fall for it.

37:38.079 --> 37:41.199
Though you've certainly
put your minister through a lot.

37:44.800 --> 37:45.719
This time,

37:46.360 --> 37:48.199
it was all thanks to your clever plan.

37:50.760 --> 37:52.039
So all these years,

37:52.440 --> 37:55.239
the calming tonic I drank
in Grandmother's palace

37:56.440 --> 37:57.760
was made from the aged renshen

37:57.960 --> 37:59.960
I had personally found for her.

38:00.440 --> 38:01.920
Your Majesty and the Grand Empress
Dowager

38:02.320 --> 38:03.400
share a deep bond,

38:04.000 --> 38:05.159
and both care for the people.

38:05.599 --> 38:07.079
That left you torn

38:07.079 --> 38:08.000
between family affection and duty.

38:10.719 --> 38:11.719
In that case,

38:12.480 --> 38:13.800
perhaps we could use

38:13.800 --> 38:15.159
the bond between grandmother
and grandson

38:15.159 --> 38:15.800
to break the deadlock.

38:23.920 --> 38:25.519
You mean...

38:31.400 --> 38:32.360
a...

38:35.880 --> 38:37.000
a self-sacrifice ploy?

38:38.199 --> 38:39.320
I will bear

38:39.840 --> 38:41.079
all the consequences.

38:41.840 --> 38:43.840
Whether I'm suspended or caned at court,

38:46.559 --> 38:48.000
I will gladly endure it.

38:50.280 --> 38:51.719
If this is a self-sacrifice ploy,

38:52.559 --> 38:53.719
how would punishing you

38:54.280 --> 38:56.559
make my grandmother feel the pain?

38:58.079 --> 38:59.440
The damage to my reputation

39:00.400 --> 39:02.760
is a burden I should bear myself.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.280
Not only did this resolve

39:06.599 --> 39:08.159
the rift between Grandmother and me,

39:08.599 --> 39:10.119
it also made me realize

39:10.119 --> 39:11.599
that Grandmother had been saving her
renshen for me.

39:12.559 --> 39:14.119
Once a man sits on the throne,

39:14.280 --> 39:15.559
even his brothers become his subjects.

39:15.880 --> 39:16.719
His wife and daughters

39:16.719 --> 39:17.679
become his subjects as well.

39:18.239 --> 39:20.159
It's been a long time since I've felt

39:20.159 --> 39:21.880
such warmth between grandmother
and grandson.

39:24.320 --> 39:26.079
Your Majesty and the Grand Empress
Dowager

39:27.039 --> 39:28.400
have always cared deeply for each other.

39:29.599 --> 39:30.760
I merely

39:31.440 --> 39:32.440
did what little I could.

39:33.440 --> 39:34.800
I wouldn't dare take credit for it.

39:36.840 --> 39:38.199
No need to be so modest, Huchen.

39:41.480 --> 39:42.280
Huchen,

39:43.000 --> 39:44.320
this strand of lapis lazuli beads

39:44.480 --> 39:45.960
has been with me for many years.

39:46.320 --> 39:47.159
Today,

39:47.360 --> 39:48.480
I bestow it upon you.

39:58.079 --> 39:59.760
When you are reinstated,

39:59.960 --> 40:01.599
I hope your heart remains as pure

40:01.599 --> 40:02.880
as this lapis,

40:03.079 --> 40:04.719
and that you seek the good
of all under heaven.

40:16.079 --> 40:17.039
Thank you, Your Majesty.

40:21.000 --> 40:21.760
And one more thing.

40:22.119 --> 40:23.400
I shall leave

40:23.880 --> 40:24.719
the disaster-relief matters

40:25.679 --> 40:27.039
to you as well.

40:28.519 --> 40:30.159
I will do everything in my power

40:31.599 --> 40:32.599
so that the disaster victims

40:35.719 --> 40:36.679
may receive Your Majesty's grace.

40:44.400 --> 40:45.480
Zhao Ling...

40:49.239 --> 40:49.960
My dear,

40:50.440 --> 40:51.960
the Yu family has a century of influence
behind it.

40:52.480 --> 40:53.880
But Zhao Ling and his wife

40:53.880 --> 40:55.280
are still newcomers at court.

40:55.280 --> 40:56.360
No matter how ambitious they are,

40:56.400 --> 40:57.039
he

40:57.039 --> 40:58.440
can't change where he came from.

40:58.719 --> 40:59.559
The way I see it,

40:59.559 --> 41:00.960
they're no match for the Yu family.

41:00.960 --> 41:01.800
Foolish.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.719
Those two

41:03.800 --> 41:05.360
have more than ambition.

41:05.360 --> 41:06.440
They have nerve.

41:06.800 --> 41:08.480
They don't just know how to fight
for power.

41:08.480 --> 41:09.800
They know how to wield it.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.840
They even dared to use the imperial
mausoleum to set a trap.

41:11.960 --> 41:14.239
What ordinary upstarts
could compare with that?

41:19.079 --> 41:20.760
I actually have a good impression

41:21.039 --> 41:22.280
of Madam Zhao.

41:22.960 --> 41:24.199
When she was kneeling

41:24.199 --> 41:25.239
outside Renshou Palace,

41:25.239 --> 41:26.360
I even specifically

41:26.360 --> 41:28.079
sent a maid to help her out.

41:28.400 --> 41:29.440
In any case,

41:29.559 --> 41:31.480
it never hurts to stay on good terms.

41:34.480 --> 41:35.360
From now on,

41:35.800 --> 41:37.239
learn more from Father.

41:37.599 --> 41:39.719
He's seen far more of the world
than you have.

41:40.480 --> 41:41.679
You're right, my dear.

41:42.400 --> 41:43.760
I'll follow Father's advice.

41:44.960 --> 41:45.960
Father, it's your turn.

41:49.080 --> 41:55.600
(Xie Residence)

41:56.920 --> 41:57.719
For the next few days,

41:57.719 --> 41:59.199
stay at Xie Jewelry Shop until things
calm down.

42:00.320 --> 42:01.920
Plain clothes and a curtained sedan
are ready.

42:01.920 --> 42:02.519
Don't worry.

42:07.679 --> 42:08.119
Come on.

42:15.960 --> 42:16.679
Mr. Jin,

42:16.679 --> 42:17.519
I'm afraid it's not a good time.

42:17.519 --> 42:19.119
Mr. Zhao and Madam Zhao are both out.

42:20.760 --> 42:21.480
No matter.

42:22.079 --> 42:22.480
How about this?

42:22.840 --> 42:23.519
Take the gifts

42:23.519 --> 42:24.159
inside for now.

42:24.159 --> 42:24.840
I'll come back another day.

42:25.360 --> 42:26.000
Mr. Jin,

42:26.119 --> 42:27.719
if we accept your gifts now,

42:28.039 --> 42:29.679
what are we supposed to do
when others bring gifts too?

42:31.440 --> 42:32.800
You're one of us.

42:33.119 --> 42:34.800
Please don't add to the commotion
right now.

42:35.000 --> 42:36.280
Everyone, please go home.

42:36.519 --> 42:38.079
Mr. Zhao really isn't accepting gifts!

42:38.400 --> 42:39.320
Please, everyone, go home.

42:42.800 --> 42:44.280
(Merchants are the most perceptive.)

42:45.199 --> 42:47.559
(They're always the first
to sense a change.)

42:48.400 --> 42:48.880
(No.)

42:49.760 --> 42:50.599
(I need to find a way)

42:50.599 --> 42:51.920
(to visit the other families too.)

42:52.559 --> 42:53.840
(I can't let those Yan merchants)

42:53.840 --> 42:55.159
(get ahead of us in the salt reform.)

42:55.560 --> 42:56.800
(Lord Wang, Minister of Personnel)

42:57.360 --> 42:59.719
I recently obtained
a nourishing prescription.

43:00.159 --> 43:01.440
It calls for astragalus root,

43:01.880 --> 43:03.960
so I had some brought from my hometown.

43:04.239 --> 43:05.159
It's only mildly bitter

43:05.159 --> 43:05.960
and leaves a sweet aftertaste.

43:06.239 --> 43:07.880
I brought it especially
for Your Majesty.

43:18.840 --> 43:19.880
Madam Zhao,

43:20.960 --> 43:22.119
come forward.

43:30.039 --> 43:31.199
A little closer.

43:35.480 --> 43:36.920
These past few days

43:37.440 --> 43:38.800
must have been hard on you.

43:39.400 --> 43:41.519
You seem

43:41.519 --> 43:42.840
to have lost some weight.

43:43.320 --> 43:44.800
You should have some renshen tonic

43:44.800 --> 43:46.159
and build your strength back up.

43:50.519 --> 43:52.199
To help ease Your Majesty's burdens

43:52.599 --> 43:54.000
is only my duty.

43:55.079 --> 43:58.039
Your husband helps shoulder
the Emperor's burdens.

43:58.400 --> 44:00.039
You should support him well.

44:01.599 --> 44:03.199
When you leave the palace,

44:03.400 --> 44:04.960
I'll have someone

44:04.960 --> 44:06.119
bring some nourishing tonics

44:06.119 --> 44:07.519
to your residence.

44:09.679 --> 44:11.599
Thank you for your kindness,
Your Majesty.

44:27.120 --> 44:29.760
(Next Episode)

44:30.000 --> 44:31.360
I'd like to see

44:32.679 --> 44:34.440
who

44:35.639 --> 44:37.079
the real Young Madam Yu is.

44:37.639 --> 44:38.920
In this family,

44:39.079 --> 44:40.079
my life

44:41.199 --> 44:42.840
is not hers to decide.

44:43.320 --> 44:45.880
From the moment you married
into the Fu family,

44:45.880 --> 44:47.159
your words

44:48.559 --> 44:49.599
have never carried any weight.

44:50.199 --> 44:52.079
That precious son-in-law of yours

44:52.079 --> 44:53.360
has been rather restless

44:53.559 --> 44:54.960
these past few months.

44:54.960 --> 44:57.559
Since your mother's grave is empty now,

44:57.920 --> 45:00.400
someone should fill it.

45:15.561 --> 45:19.881
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

45:23.481 --> 45:27.841
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

45:29.961 --> 45:34.601
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

45:34.841 --> 45:37.641
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

45:38.801 --> 45:43.441
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

45:46.641 --> 45:53.481
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

45:54.361 --> 46:00.881
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

46:01.841 --> 46:05.281
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

46:05.801 --> 46:10.001
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

46:10.281 --> 46:15.961
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

46:28.081 --> 46:31.961
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

46:35.881 --> 46:39.881
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

46:41.601 --> 46:46.281
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

46:46.601 --> 46:49.281
♪Kept close within my heart♪

46:50.361 --> 46:55.201
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

46:58.721 --> 47:05.641
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

47:06.521 --> 47:13.001
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

47:13.881 --> 47:17.401
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

47:17.841 --> 47:22.201
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

47:22.401 --> 47:28.121
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
